Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: sun4i-codec: turn the speaker off while headphones are in

On the RG35XX SP, the headphones stay silent while the speaker path is on.
Add the speaker to the jack's pins with the opposite sense, so plugging
headphones in or out switches between the two outputs.
---
--- a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
@@ -1589,6 +1589,7 @@
 
 static struct snd_soc_jack_pin sun4i_headphone_jack_pins[] = {
 	{ .pin = "Headphone", .mask = SND_JACK_HEADPHONE },
+	{ .pin = "Speaker", .mask = SND_JACK_HEADPHONE, .invert = 1 },
 };
 
 static struct snd_soc_jack_gpio sun4i_headphone_jack_gpio = {
